{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And when you slaughter</b> — juxtaposed to \"it and its son.\" Hints at what they said in the four periods of the year: one must notify its mother, \"I have sold it today, to slaughter,\" and all the periods are on the festivals. Therefore it is juxtaposed to the festivals."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:17.277653699Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}